[I] A fast & densely stored hashmap and hashset

[T] unordered_dense provides ankerl::unordered_dense::map and set,
[T] header-only C++17 hash containers that are almost drop-in replacements
[T] for std::unordered_map and std::unordered_set. They use robin-hood
[T] hashing with backward shift deletion and store elements contiguously for
[T] very fast iteration.

[U] https://github.com/martinus/unordered_dense

